{"name":"Hearty Quel'dorei Medley","quality":4,"icon":"inv_cooking_10_draconicdelicacies","tooltip":"<table><tr><td><!--nstart--><b class=\"q4\">Hearty Quel'dorei Medley</b><!--nend--><!--ndstart--><!--ndend--><span class=\"q whtt-extra whtt-ilvl\"><br>Item Level <!--ilvl-->24</span><!--bo--><br><span class=\"q7\">Binds to Warband</span><!--ue--><!--ue--><!--ebstats--><!--egstats--><!--eistats--><!--nameDescStats--></td></tr></table><table><tr><td><!--useText:0:1--><span id=\"useText1\" class=\"q2\">Use: <!--useEffect:0:1--><a href=\"/spell=1278915/hearty-queldorei-medley\" class=\"q2\">Place a <span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">Hearty Quel'dorei Medley</span> for all players to enjoy!<br /><br /><a href=\"/spell=1232065/food-amp;-drink\" target=\"_blank\">Restores 7% of your maximum health and mana every second over 20 sec. Must remain seated while eating.</a><br /><br /><span class=\"tooltip-inside-icon\" style=\"background-image: url(//wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/small/spell_misc_food.jpg)\"></span> <span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">Hearty Well Fed</span><br />If you spend at least 10 seconds eating, you will become <span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">Hearty Well Fed</span> gaining <!--pts7:0:0:1219179-->98<!----> Stamina and <!--pts4:0:0:1219179-->64<!----> of your highest secondary stat for 1 hour.<br /><br />This aura persists through death.<!--?242744:1:90:90:15249:0:0:90--></a><!--useEffect:1--></span><!--useText:1--><!--itemEffects:1--><br>Requires Level <!--rlvl-->90<br><!--pvpEquip--><!--pvpEquip--><div class=\"whtt-extra whtt-maxstack\">Max Stack: 1000</div><div class=\"whtt-sellprice\">Sell Price: <span class=\"moneysilver\">33</span> <span class=\"moneycopper\">50</span></div></td></tr></table>","spells":[]}